 ndfulness. This MBAR facilitator training explores mindfulness-based tools
  for working with addictive and compulsive behaviours — in your personal
  life\, workplace\, or community. Ideal for professionals\, people in reco
 very\, and those training to become MBAR facilitators.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-based-addict
 ion-recovery-mbar-training
